<title>UK: GMAC sets $200 million three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>GMAC sets $200 million three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Waruburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    03.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.103   PAY DATE    03.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.953    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 U.S. TREASURY DUE FEB.2000</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
